              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhammaan ma wada leeyihiin hadiyado wax lagu bogsiiyo? Dhammaan ma ku hadlaan afaf kala cayn ah? Dhammaan wax ma fasiraan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
